  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "14",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>",
